---
title: Kiwi-Strawberry-Spinach Salad
author: Mary Arntson
category: Salads
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@spinach
@kiwi
@strawberries
@poppy seeds{1%Tbsp}
@sesame seeds{2%Tbsp}
@grated onion{1.5%tsp}
@Worcestershire sauce{1/4%tsp}
@oil{1/4%c}
@vinegar{1/4%c}
@sugar{1/3%c}
@paprika{1/4%tsp}

Spinach - washed and torn. Kiwi - peeled and sliced. Strawberries - sliced.

==Dressing==
Put all dressing ingredients except vinegar in blender. Slowly add vinegar until thick.
